    "title": "",
    "text": "Whatever cards Collins has at her disposal, she needs to play them all. They'll try to hang Trump around her neck, but she has plenty of return ammo on that score and can honestly claim that she votes her conscience and according to what she thinks is best for the people of Maine. I know she's often been a thorn in our side, but I do believe she votes in accordance with what she thinks is right. She just voted to fund ICE to the end of Trump's term knowing how much it would displease many Maine voters while also knowing it was the right thing to do.\nI agree she should play the nepo baby, silver spoon thing to the hilt. Platner is, and always has been, a person of privilege ( white privilege) who is masquerading as a working class hero.",
